(wind-output-harness)
*title Wind and output table harness
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*wind geodetic windv=(wind-speed) windh=0 windd=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=0.0 long=0.0 lat=0.0 vel=100.0 gama=0.0 psi=0.0 time=0.0 mass=50.0
  *define output_sample
    output_sample = table(example-output);
  *file wind-output.dat time windv output_sample
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.1
    *when time>0.2 stop
*end
